  "full_text": "So, like, they don't talk much. If you don't talk, you're pretty easy to forget. So, God likes soap operas. The obvious answer is... Okay. I used to respond to everything, but I don't think I'm going to respond to everything. What? Someone once answered that I used to be overly nice. Now, fuck it. Someone wants to know, someone wants an oracle. What? Are you busy? No. So I'm supposed to, I think, okay, so this has to be G-rated. So the first thing you want to know, or the first thing you have to remember is don't make it the friend zone. That's stupid. So just remember that. Not the friend zone. Spam. I used to be very conscientious. What happened? Okay, so I'm going to go talk to Simone.",
